---
description: Load agent skills from local open-agent-skills clone under .agentic/
alwaysApply: true
---

Apply shared [guardrails](.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/_shared/guardrails.md) whenever you follow a skill from this table.

Clone the marketplace first if paths are missing: see [docs/agent-skills-setup.md](docs/agent-skills-setup.md).

| Skill | Path | When to use |
|-------|------|-------------|
| functional-spec | [.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/functional-spec/SKILL.md](.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/functional-spec/SKILL.md) | New or updated product spec before engineering |
| technical-spec | [.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/technical-spec/SKILL.md](.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/technical-spec/SKILL.md) | Engineering spec from a locked functional spec |
| loop-build | [.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/loop-build/SKILL.md](.agentic/open-agent-skills/skills/loop-build/SKILL.md) | Implement from specs with test + screenshot verification loops |

**Pipeline order (spec-to-ship):** functional-spec → technical-spec → loop-build.

Default feature artifacts for this repo:

```text
docs/features/<feature>/
├── functional-spec.md
├── technical-spec.md
└── loop-state.md
```

Repo architecture and E2E conventions: [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md).
